      "what": "the amplifying coefficients (Vaporize and Melt: 2.0 or 1.5 by the trigger element), the additive ones (Aggravate 1.15, Spread 1.25), the Lunar and Stellar reaction multipliers and the Stellar-Conduct table by recorded hits (0 to 12), the Polestar field's Cryo and Electro DMG Bonus by the same count (20% with none, 29% with one, 30% to 40% with two to twelve; the field also lowers Physical RES by 40%), and the enemy the verdict assumes (level 100, 10% RES)",
